  "question": "What gallery exist within a 180 kilometers distance north of Strawberry Hill, San Francisco, CA?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS  (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-122.475512 37.768668)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois, origin\nWHERE ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-122.475512 37.768668)',4326)::geography, 180000)\nAND tourism = 'gallery'\nAND ((degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 0.0 AND 22.5) OR (degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 337.5 AND 360));\n",
